Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:06:10.54,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 华盛顿 WTA500 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:06:10.54,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38}4-6 6-4 6-0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 佩古拉 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex, congrats on your first WTA title.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你拿到第一个 WTA 冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Just your thoughts on your win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说这场胜利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, I'm over the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,天呐 我高兴坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, taking it all in right now and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在还在慢慢消化
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,just pure happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是纯粹的快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Great questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 继续提问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you talk through the last like 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,能讲讲过去这 24 小时吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,what it was like in the first part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛前半段是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match, all the waiting you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么长的等待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,had to do and then what felt different uh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有重新开打之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,in the resumption
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:28.56,EN,,0,0,0,,because it really seemed Jess said it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西说那基本上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.32,EN,,0,0,0,,was like two different matches basically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,像是两场不同的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.32,EN,,0,0,0,,with the conditions and I guess how well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为场地条件不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,you were playing today also.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,也因为你今天打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Um no, it it's been a crazy 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这 24 小时确实很疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:42.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course, I think I've warmed up like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我大概
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,热身了一千次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,um a lot of un unpredictable swings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,天气变化完全没法预料
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.68,EN,,0,0,0,,with the weather and I want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢赛事方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:53.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank the tournament for just you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们特别配合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,being so accommodating helping us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮我们撑了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.76,EN,,0,0,0,,through it and and you know uh arranging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,把决赛安排到周一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,this Monday final was was really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:06.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was difficult I think um
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实挺难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:09.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to kind of like I don't well
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,at at the same time it's happened
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to me a lot you know rain delays a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我遇到过很多次了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of times in my life I think this is just kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,雨延期在我的生涯里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,of another one of those although it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,也就是又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,was a lot higher stakes um
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是这次赌注大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but I think I was able you know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:27.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to take my time and and and you know kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,慢慢来 不着急
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of take those learnings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,把上半场学到的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:29.92,EN,,0,0,0,,from the first half of the match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,记住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and do my best to apply them in the second
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,下半场尽量用上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think it worked pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得效果不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.20,EN,,0,0,0,,How it seemed like the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天现场好像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,was even more vocal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,声音更大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and even maybe even more Filipino today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,菲律宾观众也更多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,than yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,比昨天还多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you notice that as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你也感觉到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:41.52,EN,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:41.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,But um I was so pleasantly surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今天的上座
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,with uh the turnout today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我特别惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Um and super grateful for all the fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别感谢那些球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:53.12,EN,,0,0,0,,who waited the whole day yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,昨天等了一整天的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,They really stuck it out and and the people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们真的撑住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:57.52,EN,,0,0,0,,back home I know like couldn't get a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道国内的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,也没怎么睡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:01:59.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So super grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:01:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,太感谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and and I hope you guys enjoyed the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你们看得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场决赛的结尾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:05.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:05.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Hey, Alex, congratulations on the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊埃拉 恭喜夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,You've talked all week about how you've
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周你一直在说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,been able to kind of stay locked
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么保持专注
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:12.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in with everything that's going
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不被周围的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:13.36,EN,,0,0,0,,on around you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,影响
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but that immediate moment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但赛点落地那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,when you collapsed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你整个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:17.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to the ground after match point,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,瘫倒在地上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,how would you describe your emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一刻你的情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in that moment and the things you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及你当时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,were thinking in that immediate moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,脑子里在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,O, I was so nervous and and I kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我太紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of just blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,整个人是懵的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I everything just came rushing to me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有东西一下子涌上来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and I was really nervous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后那几分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,before the last couple of points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and I was really trying to to channel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直想把这些紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,those nerves into hitting good balls
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,变成把球打好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and moving my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,变成把脚动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:44.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, a lot a huge burst of emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,情绪一下子全炸开了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:45.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, hi Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好 伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. So, I guess it's kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜 有件事挺巧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of a cool thing where Jess's first title
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西的第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,is actually here in Washington in 2019.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是 2019 年在华盛顿拿的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,And for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,而对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.36,EN,,0,0,0,,it's obviously your first the draw
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是第一个 而你这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that you had throughout here was kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,遇到的签表
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:56.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of kind of insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,简直离谱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:56.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,based off you beat the top three seeds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你赢了前三号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and, you know, the quality of opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手的质量摆在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Just curious reflecting back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,回头看这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:03.04,EN,,0,0,0,,on that, just how much can you take away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你能带走多少东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,from this tournament knowing the quality
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你赢下的这些对手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of opponents you've beaten, not just here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.52,EN,,0,0,0,,but you know, recently as of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,最近这段也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, so many takeaways
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一站让我学到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,from this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, and I think I ended the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得打完的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in better shape than I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我比开始时状态更好
